+# BLUE CURRENT V48.15.0 — EXECUTIVE PILOT REVIEW PACKET
+
+V48.11–V48.15 turns the structured proof program into a decision-ready executive artifact.
+
+## Added
+- Executive review packet generated directly from V48 proof evidence
+- Baseline vs current readiness, operating rhythm, modeled leakage, and verified realized value
+- Success-gate PASS/OPEN presentation
+- Per-location objective and target review
+- Pilot exception summary
+- Recommendation, confidence, rationale, and next action
+- Human-readable text packet for copying into executive communications
+- Immutable-style archived review snapshots in `executivePilotReviews`
+- Audit event and realtime publication when a packet is archived
+
+## Evidence boundaries
+The packet preserves the V48 evidence discipline:
+- verified realized value comes only from measured completed-action outcomes
+- readiness, operating rhythm, and modeled leakage are observed movement
+- observed movement is not automatically attributed to Blue Current
+- recommendation is decision support only
+- commercial commitment requires a human
+- automatic commercial commitment is disabled
+
+## Authenticated Chefs integration result
+Using an isolated copy of the current runtime:
+- review status: READY
+- locations reviewed: 5
+- current recommendation: INTERVENE
+- verified realized value: $0
+- text packet generated: 1,640 characters
+- archived review created successfully
+
+This remains intentionally conservative at the beginning of the pilot.
+
+## API
+GET `/api/executive-pilot-review`
+GET `/api/executive-pilot-review/text`
+POST `/api/executive-pilot-review/archive`
+
+## Validation
+- 872 JavaScript files
+- 740 client scripts
+- 5,519 unique HTML IDs
+- focused executive review test PASS
+- authenticated review GET PASS
+- authenticated text packet GET PASS
+- authenticated archive POST PASS
+- authoritative runtime database unchanged
+- npm run check PASS
+
+## Next
+V48.16–V48.20 should add the pilot decision ledger and executive sign-off workflow so leadership can record the actual human decision, conditions, approver, rollout scope, and follow-up obligations without allowing Blue Current to auto-approve expansion.
